{
  "uid": "pt-ci-deploys",
  "title": "CI and Deploys",
  "description": "What the CI poller is doing and what each process is actually running. Version facts come from the applications themselves; deploy facts come from the poller and cover automatic deploys only.",
  "tags": [
    "performance-tracker",
    "ci",
    "observability"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Right now",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CI alive",
      "description": "Age of the last completed poll cycle. The poller stamps this after every cycle whether the cycle threw or not, so it answers 'is the loop turning'. If the poller dies, nothing else says so: no build starts and every pull request simply waits. Red past 300s.",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - ci_poller_last_poll_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "since last poll",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Hosts in agreement",
      "description": "Distinct commits running across every scraped process. 1 means the server and the cron agree. Anything higher means a partial deploy, which used to be discoverable only by sshing into each host and running git rev-parse.",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (commit) (app_build_info))",
          "legendFormat": "distinct commits",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "agreed",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Deployed version verified",
      "description": "The poller reading app_build_info back off each host after a deploy and comparing it with the SHA it shipped. 0 means every step reported success and the wrong code is serving, which is the failure the deploy scripts have always worked around blind. No data until the first automatic deploy runs.",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min(deploy_version_verified)",
          "legendFormat": "verified",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "MISMATCH",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "verified",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "main last green",
      "description": "How long since main last passed validation. Grows without bound if main is red or if nothing is being merged; read it beside the runs panel below.",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - ci_last_success_timestamp_seconds{ref_type=\"main\"}",
          "legendFormat": "since last green main",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 86400
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "What is running",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Version per process",
      "description": "Read from each process at boot, so it describes the code actually loaded rather than what a deploy believed it shipped. True regardless of who deployed or how. version is `git describe --tags --always`, which becomes meaningful once the deploy/prod/* tags the poller pushes exist.",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "app_build_info",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "service": "process",
              "commit": "commit",
              "branch": "branch",
              "version": "version",
              "instance_id": "pm2 instance"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime since last restart",
      "description": "Per process. A deploy restarts everything, so a young uptime across the board means something shipped recently. Not a deploy counter, though: this process has restarted hundreds of times without one, which is exactly why no panel here infers deploys from restarts.",
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - app_start_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{instance_id}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Version running over time",
      "description": "Each band is a version being served. A band ending and another starting is a deploy landing, whoever ran it. Bands that start at different times for server and cron are a deploy that reached one host before the other, which is normal for a few seconds and a problem if it persists.",
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
